              "promptBlocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Writing 2(2021届“决胜高考”新高考八省一模) "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "　　假定你是李华,你校羽毛球俱乐部下周将举行校羽毛球决赛。请写一封邮件,邀请你的外国朋友Sam与你一起观看,内容包括:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1.比赛安排;2.见面时间、地点;3.表达期待。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "注意:"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1.词数80左右;"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "2.可适当增加细节,以使行文连贯。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "placement": {
                "kind": "standalone"
              },
              "options": [],
              "blanks": [],
              "answerSpec": {
                "availability": "answered",
                "gradingMode": "manual",
                "kind": "reference",
                "referenceAnswer": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "One possible version:"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Dear Sam,"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "I'm extremely excited to tell you that our school badminton club will hold the final competition next Friday at 3 o'clock in the afternoon. Knowing that you're rather interested in it, I'm sure you will want to watch it."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "As scheduled, the match will take place in the school gym beside the teaching building. Therefore, if it is convenient for you, how about we meet at the school gate at 2: 45 on Friday afternoon? There is no doubt that you will be extremely impressed by the excellent athletic skills of the participating contestants and have a better understanding of the fascination of this sport."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "I sincerely hope you can come. If so, I will reserve a seat next to me for you. I'm looking forward to your reply."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Yours,"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Li Hua"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
