              "promptBlocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Writing 3(2021届湖南五市十校10月大联考) "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "　　12月3日是国际残疾人日(International Day of Persons with Disability),请你以学校英语俱乐部的名义向同学们写一封倡议信,内容包括: "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "1.倡议的主题:我为残疾人做点什么?2.活动安排:国际残疾人日当天,访问残疾人。3.今后的打算。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "注意:写作词数应为80左右。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Dear Classmates,"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "runs": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The Students English Club"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "placement": {
                "kind": "standalone"
              },
              "options": [],
              "blanks": [],
              "answerSpec": {
                "availability": "answered",
                "gradingMode": "manual",
                "kind": "reference",
                "referenceAnswer": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "One possible version:"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Dear classmates, "
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "December 3, International Day of Persons with Disability, is around the corner. To show our great concern about the disabled, we Students Union will organize an activity with the theme “What can we do for the disabled”. Anyone who volunteers is welcome. On that day, we will visit some disabled people near our school, doing some work for them, such as cleaning their houses and washing clothes. To make this kind of activity become regular, every one of us is welcome to have a disabled person as a partner, and will do what we can to help them."
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "runs": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The Students English Club "
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
